<title>USA: FPL Group Q2 net up due to weather, growth.</title>
<headline>FPL Group Q2 net up due to weather, growth.</headline>
<dateline>JUNO BEACH, Fla. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>FPL Group Inc said Tuesday its improved results for its second quarter, ended June 30, reflect higher sales from customer growth and warmer weather.</p>
<p>The company said warm weather continued into July, when on July 8 it set a new summer peak load of 16,329 megawatts.</p>
